### S3 Integration Test Endpoints
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or curl

### 1. Customer Profile Picture Upload
POST http://localhost:3000/customer/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. Get Customer Profile (should include profile picture URLs)
GET http://localhost:3000/customer/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Business Owner Profile Picture Upload  
POST http://localhost:3000/business-owner/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="business-owner-profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4. Business Owner Business Media Upload (Multiple Files)
POST http://localhost:3000/business-owner/business-media
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="portfolio1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/portfolio1.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="portfolio2.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./path/to/portfolio2.mp4
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 5. Get Business Media
GET http://localhost:3000/business-owner/business-media
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Delete Business Media
DELETE http://localhost:3000/business-owner/business-media/MEDIA_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Get Business Owner Profile (Updated - now returns single address)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/business-owner/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 8. Get Customer Profile (For comparison - no addresses in profile)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

